NOTE ON OUTPUT

This project generates textual prompts only. It contains no images and no
trained models. Prompts produced by this software deliberately avoid naming
living artists, studios, franchises, brands or public figures; they describe
generic visual techniques and features instead.

You are responsible for how you use generated output, including complying with
the terms of service of whichever image or video generation platform you
submit prompts to. No affiliation with or resemblance to any existing
character, artwork or brand is claimed or implied.